          "year": 2013,
          "date_decided": "2013-03-29",
          "holding": "The court reversed an order terminating the wardship and DCFS guardianship of a nineteen-year-old, holding the circuit court made none of the written findings section 2-31(2) requires and that closure was against the manifest weight of the evidence, and remanded to extend wardship toward age twenty-one.",
